{"video":"RvZcNDj_gQM","lines":[{"t":[1,2.5],"en":"-Hey, Jim. Jim."},{"t":[2.5,4],"en":"Come here."},{"t":[4,6.2],"en":"Do you know who that is?"},{"t":[6.2,7.5],"en":"-No. -Look at him."},{"t":[7.5,9],"en":"Look at him. T-shirt, jeans."},{"t":[9,12.8],"en":"-Is it you? -I am flattered."},{"t":[12.8,14.7],"en":"That's Johnny Depp. -Where'd you take that?"},{"t":[14.7,16.7],"en":"-In my condo complex."},{"t":[16.7,18.3],"en":"-Oh, my God. That's right."},{"t":[18.3,19.8],"en":"I read in \"People\" magazine that he was looking"},{"t":[19.8,21.2],"en":"for a two-bedroom condo in Scranton."},{"t":[21.2,22.8],"en":"-I'm flipping out, man."},{"t":[22.8,24.8],"en":"-Well, you remember my idea for the fourth Pirates movie."},{"t":[24.8,26],"en":"-Sure. -That they should do one."},{"t":[26,28.5],"en":"-Hey, Jim. Jim, where --"},{"t":[28.5,30.5],"en":"where do I find the Black Pearl?"},{"t":[30.5,32.8],"en":"-Who's that? -Captain Jack Sparrow."},{"t":[32.8,34.6],"en":"Captain Jack Sparrow, Jim."},{"t":[34.6,37],"en":"-John Dillinger."},{"t":[37,39],"en":"-No, I'm Captain Jack Sparrow."},{"t":[39,40.9],"en":"-Captain Crunch. Crunch."},{"t":[40.9,42.7],"en":"-Okay. Okay."},{"t":[42.7,44.7],"en":"Screw you, Halpert."},{"t":[44.7,48.2],"en":"You know, it's not easy getting excited about stuff."},{"t":[48.2,50.5],"en":"Remember how you felt when you thought you'd seen Roger Clemens?"},{"t":[50.5,51.9],"en":"-At the Yankees game. -Yeah."},{"t":[51.9,53],"en":"Well, it wasn't him."},{"t":[53,56.2],"en":"I had a little better reason to believe that..."},{"t":[56.2,58.2],"en":"You're right. You're right."},{"t":[58.2,60.1],"en":"-Well, you're not right, because Johnny Depp..."},{"t":[60.1,61.7],"en":"-I know. -...in your condo complex..."},{"t":[61.7,62.5],"en":"-I know."},{"t":[62.5,66.3],"en":"It also explains why the name on his mailbox was M. Shulman."},{"t":[69.9,71.3],"en":"-M. Night Shulman?"}]}
